<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 9</span></div>
	
			<h2>Parallel park</h2>
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>One of the most important skills for a driver and an autonomous car is parking. Parking can be tricky, especially parallel parking. Parallel parking is when you need to park on the side of the road in between two cars or objects.</p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="900" height="360" src="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/zumi_parallel_park-900x360.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="" title="zumi_parallel_park" srcset="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/zumi_parallel_park.jpg 900w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/zumi_parallel_park-300x120.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>

	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><strong>Activity: </strong>Set up two objects or Zumis to be cars parked on the side of the road a little bit ahead of where Zumi is. Use the drive forward command to drive up to the space, then use the parallel parking block to park. It may take some practice getting the parameters right.</p>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="359" src="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Screen-Shot-2021-07-13-at-12.38.20-PM-1024x359.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="zumi blockly parking example" title="zumi blockly parking example" srcset="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Screen-Shot-2021-07-13-at-12.38.20-PM-1024x359.png 1024w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Screen-Shot-2021-07-13-at-12.38.20-PM-300x105.png 300w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Screen-Shot-2021-07-13-at-12.38.20-PM.png 1084w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></div>
		</figure>
